        "exposedClass": "review-required",
        "statement": "After upgrading to Kyverno 1.13 with features.policyExceptions.namespace unset, PolicyExceptions can no longer be configured in all namespaces; the prior behavior is only preserved by explicitly setting the value.",
        "remediation": "Set the Helm value features.policyExceptions.namespace to * to keep allowing PolicyExceptions in all namespaces, or set it to a single namespace as the guide recommends.",
        "severity": "medium"
      },
      "statement": "Upgrading to Kyverno 1.13 changes configuration handling so that PolicyExceptions can no longer be configured in all namespaces by default: to continue allowing exceptions in all namespaces, the Helm value features.policyExceptions.namespace must be set to `*`, although limiting exceptions to a specific namespace is recommended."
